    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2154daf21d67f3bd11d69767f78cd70dafab51002b737a30d3cb78a90521f4dc",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n前进，前进，左转……\n哎呀！有一张卡错了。\n一张一张地查。\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
